# A stage0 sample program (docs/refined-examples/stage0/samples). Run it with
# `refined run`, or compile it with stage0 and run what stage0 builds.

outEnds is project
outEnds purpose "An audit program just outside the stage0 subset, which refined accepts; stage0 refuses it"
outEnds target console
outEnds version "0.1.0"
outEnds language refined 1
outEnds standardLibrary 1
outEnds allows write console.stdout none
outEnds requires none
outEnds includesModule outEnds
outEnds entry outEnds.main
